flickos-weather (1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The weather in the panel (docs/design/flickos-weather.md): the
    temperature and the sky now, the next hours and days in the tooltip,
    for a place picked by hand, from Open-Meteo.com. Off by default;
    while on, waybar runs it every 15 minutes and it asks the weather
    service at most once an hour, sending only the place's position
    rounded to about 1 km (PRIVACY.md). No daemon.

